msgid "Connect dApps to Cubensis Connect and sign transactions on behalf of users."
msgstr "Conecte dApps ao Cubensis Connect e assine transações em nome dos usuários."

#: ../../04_building-apps/index.md:72
msgid "Task-by-task recipes: transactions, airdrops, payments, token exchange, voting and list arguments."
